Score questions with a hosted decision model

Usage: wally decisions [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            Decision model (default pplx-decider-v1)
  -i, --input TEXT            Text every question is about
      --input-file TEXT       Read input from PATH (- for stdin)
      --ask TEXT ...          Yes/no question (repeatable)
      --choice TEXT ...       Choice question as 'QUESTION=a,b,c' (repeatable)
      --score TEXT ...        Score question as
                              'QUESTION=none,minor,major,outage' (repeatable)
      --request TEXT          Complete DecisionsRequest JSON file (- for stdin)
      --temperature FLOAT     Probability temperature (>0, at most 100)
      --json                  Print the raw response JSON
      --no-retry              Do not retry HTTP 429 or 503

Examples:
  wally decisions --input 'Checkout is blank' --ask 'Is this a bug?'

  wally decide --input-file ticket.txt --choice 'Owner=frontend,payments,account'
